        "accession_number": "0000038777-25-000238",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For over 75 years, we have been committed to providing clients with exceptional investment management services and have developed a globally diversified business, including through strategic acquisitions.",
        "start_character": 1634,
        "end_character": 1838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000038777-25-000238",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000038777-25-000238-6cb0dfcd42c8f61c",
        "accession_number": "0000038777-25-000238",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our fees for providing investment management services are generally based on a percentage of AUM in the accounts that we advise, and vary based on the asset classes of the accounts, the types of services that we provide, and the market for those services.",
        "start_character": 8766,
        "end_character": 9021
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000038777-25-000238",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000038777-25-000238-6cb0dfcd42c8f61c",
        "accession_number": "0000038777-25-000238",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our specialist investment managers provide investment management services pursuant to agreements with each of our investment products and/or clients, including products for which we provide sub-advisory services.",
        "start_character": 13131,
        "end_character": 13343
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000038777-25-000238",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000038777-25-000238-6cb0dfcd42c8f61c",
        "accession_number": "0000038777-25-000238",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Over the years, we have expanded and developed our business to meet evolving investor needs, in part, by acquiring companies engaged in investment management and related services.",
        "start_character": 4618,
        "end_character": 4797
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000038777-25-000238",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000038777-25-000238-6cb0dfcd42c8f61c",
        "accession_number": "0000038777-25-000238",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The global business and regulatory environments in which we operate remain complex, uncertain and subject to change.",
